  "why": "Uncertainty and fail-closed as in 1.6 (0044 K3, 0036 V7): 80.5 +/- 2 against 80 is unknown, and an unknown `if` fails the run (S261). A model must not move the limit to avoid it. Under 2.1 `fill` is no kind (E217).",
  "attempt_fails_with": "E101"
